Well, after 3 games, we found a little bug with Mac Nethack 3.1.3:
In the initial "who are you" dialog box, DON'T use a dash (minus sign) in your
name. You will get all sorts of "blah blah:perhaps you'd better quit."
messages and some other very strange happenings as well. I haven't tested to
see if other keys produce a similar problem.

This isn't ment to be a flame, just a helping hand.


